    "一般球局，包含走动和短暂停顿" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Casual play with movement and short pauses"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一般球局，包含走動與短暫停頓"}}}},
