    "千卡/天" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"kcal/day"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"大卡/天"}}}},
    "没有合适结果？自行填写" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No suitable result? Enter manually"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有合適結果？自行填寫"}}}},
    "的联想" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" suggestions"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"的聯想"}}}},
    "每100克" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Per 100 g"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每100克"}}}},
    "总脂肪" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Total Fat"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"總脂肪"}}}},
    "约" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approx."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"約"}}}},
    "精确值未提供" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exact value not provided"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未提供精確值"}}}},
    "范围下限不能大于上限。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The range minimum can’t exceed the maximum."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"範圍下限不能大於上限。"}}}},
    "精确值必须落在填写的范围内。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The exact value must fall within the entered range."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"精確值必須落在填寫的範圍內。"}}}},
    "日均参考必须是大于 0 且小于 10,000 的有效千卡数。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The daily reference must be a valid calorie value greater than 0 and less than 10,000."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"日均參考必須是大於 0 且小於 10,000 的有效大卡數。"}}}},
    "数据库中没有找到该商品，可以改用手动输入（参考包装上的营养标签）" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This product wasn’t found in the database. Enter it manually using the package nutrition label."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"資料庫中找不到此商品，可改用手動輸入（參考包裝上的營養標示）。"}}}},
    "找到了商品，但数据库没有可靠热量数据。请扫描包装上的营养表" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The product was found, but the database has no reliable calorie data. Scan the package nutrition label."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已找到商品，但資料庫沒有可靠的熱量資料。請掃描包裝上的營養標示。"}}}},
    "照片数据为空，请重新拍摄" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The photo is empty. Take it again."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"照片資料為空，請重新拍攝。"}}}},
    "无法读取这张营养表照片" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Couldn’t read this nutrition-label photo"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無法讀取這張營養標示照片"}}}},
    "本机文字识别失败" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On-device text recognition failed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機文字辨識失敗"}}}},
    "没有识别到营养表文字，请靠近并保持镜头平行后重拍" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No nutrition-label text was found. Move closer, keep the camera parallel, and retake the photo."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有辨識到營養標示文字，請靠近並保持鏡頭平行後重拍。"}}}},
    "饮食已保存在 App，但当前无法写入 Apple 健康。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The food entry is saved in the app, but it can’t currently be written to Apple Health."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"飲食已儲存在 App，但目前無法寫入 Apple 健康。"}}}},
    "同步状态未能保存，请稍后重试。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The sync status couldn’t be saved. Please try again later."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"同步狀態無法儲存，請稍後再試。"}}}},
    "已撤销" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Undone"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已復原"}}}},
    "确认记录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Log Entry"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"確認記錄"}}}},
